{"3553070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AFRA Survivor: Adventure", "steam_appid": 3553070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AFRA Survivor: Adventure</strong> is the first spin-off of the AFRA Survivor franchise, introducing fully controllable characters for the first time, without losing its narrative identity and unique atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Streets of Rage</i>, <i>Golden Axe</i>, and <i>Shinobi</i>, the game combines beat ’em up and hack and slash elements in a direct, fluid, and challenging combat experience. The hand-drawn graphics reinforce its visual identity, while the orchestral soundtrack intensifies each encounter with an epic approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/f751e1239da0a332cb30b7843a363f86.poster.avif?t=1778045773\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/f751e1239da0a332cb30b7843a363f86.webm?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/f751e1239da0a332cb30b7843a363f86.mp4?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world dominated by machines and artificial intelligences, the few remaining humans struggle to survive. Face waves of enemies across different game modes, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Brawler Mode (Classic Beat ’em Up)<br>● Survival Mode (Arena-style Survival)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/cd46ecd6907ba8a20450aa2ee3b82110.poster.avif?t=1778045773\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/cd46ecd6907ba8a20450aa2ee3b82110.webm?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/cd46ecd6907ba8a20450aa2ee3b82110.mp4?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four initial playable characters, each with unique abilities, distinct combat styles, and progressive challenges that require adaptation and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/0dbd2a544b2ae88c01ac9f8d47ffa0f5.poster.avif?t=1778045773\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/0dbd2a544b2ae88c01ac9f8d47ffa0f5.webm?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/0dbd2a544b2ae88c01ac9f8d47ffa0f5.mp4?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available languages with culturally adapted terminology: Brazilian Portuguese, English, Spanish, Simplified Chinese (简体中文), and Japanese (日本語).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/e28a2a6ee736846e7b39b73c77c5d30e.poster.avif?t=1778045773\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/e28a2a6ee736846e7b39b73c77c5d30e.webm?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/e28a2a6ee736846e7b39b73c77c5d30e.mp4?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All soundtracks were composed exclusively by Anderson Antero. The music content is free from copyright claims on YouTube, allowing unrestricted streaming and monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/3467d29429d5f56f2075737fdd9d4cbb.avif?t=1778045773\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL SETTINGS SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Difficulty adjustment<br>● Languages<br>● Video and audio<br>● Character customization<br>● Achievement system<br>● Integrated tutorial<br>● Automatic keyboard and controller support<br>● Brawler Mode with 10 stages<br>● Survival Mode with 10 stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AFRA Survivor: Adventure</strong> is the first spin-off of the AFRA Survivor franchise, introducing fully controllable characters for the first time, without losing its narrative identity and unique atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Streets of Rage</i>, <i>Golden Axe</i>, and <i>Shinobi</i>, the game combines beat ’em up and hack and slash elements in a direct, fluid, and challenging combat experience. The hand-drawn graphics reinforce its visual identity, while the orchestral soundtrack intensifies each encounter with an epic approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/f751e1239da0a332cb30b7843a363f86.poster.avif?t=1778045773\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/f751e1239da0a332cb30b7843a363f86.webm?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/f751e1239da0a332cb30b7843a363f86.mp4?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world dominated by machines and artificial intelligences, the few remaining humans struggle to survive. Face waves of enemies across different game modes, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Brawler Mode (Classic Beat ’em Up)<br>● Survival Mode (Arena-style Survival)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/cd46ecd6907ba8a20450aa2ee3b82110.poster.avif?t=1778045773\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/cd46ecd6907ba8a20450aa2ee3b82110.webm?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/extras/cd46ecd6907ba8a20450aa2ee3b82110.mp4?t=1778045773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four initial playable characters, each with unique abilities, distinct combat styles, and progressive challenges that require adaptation and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"