 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL SETTINGS SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Difficulty adjustment<br>● Languages<br>● Video and audio<br>● Character customization<br>● Achievement system<br>● Integrated tutorial<br>● Automatic keyboard and controller support<br>● Brawler Mode with 10 stages<br>● Survival Mode with 10 stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A post-apocalyptic game set in a world taken over by the revolution of machines and artificial intelligence, which in turn aims to exterminate the human race. The game contains several modes, including the classic beat'em up/Hack and slash and the arena-style survival mode.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/d660fd7f19ef5cbd0666c5a24d003ed626b7d1f5/header.jpg?t=1778045773", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/20bdf29807194626f33670ac9cb34045dd3e962d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778045773", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553070/20bdf29807194626f33670ac9cb34045dd3e962d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778045773", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU &amp; 3.10GHz 3.10 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> simple<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb